\">خلاصه دمو</a></nav><a class=\"rounded-xl bg-[#27D6D0] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-[#061923] hover:bg-[#0EA7A3]\" href=\"/intake\">شروع پیش‌ویزیت</a></div></header><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#F6FBFC] px-4 py-8 text-[#183B56] sm:px-6 sm:py-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl\"><nav aria-label=\"مسیر پیش‌ویزیت\" class=\"salamax-card salamax-scroll-x mb-6 max-w-full overflow-x-auto rounded-3xl p-3 shadow-sm\" dir=\"rtl\"><ol class=\"flex min-w-max items-center gap-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition border-[rgba(14,167,163,0.6)] bg-[rgba(14,167,163,0.12)] text-[#F4F7F8]\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#0EA7A3] text-[#061923]\">✓</span>شرح حال</span><span class=\"h-px w-5 bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.16)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition border-[rgba(14,167,163,0.6)] bg-[rgba(14,167,163,0.12)] text-[#F4F7F8]\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#0EA7A3] text-[#061923]\">✓</span>مسیر مراجعه</span><span class=\"h-px w-5 bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.16)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition border-[rgba(14,167,163,0.6)] bg-[rgba(14,167,163,0.12)] text-[#F4F7F8]\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#0EA7A3] text-[#061923]\">✓</span>مدارک</span><span class=\"h-px w-5 bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.16)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition border-[rgba(14,167,163,0.6)] bg-[rgba(14,167,163,0.12)] text-[#F4F7F8]\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#0EA7A3] text-[#061923]\">✓</span>تحلیل</span><span class=\"h-px w-5 bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.16)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition border-[rgba(14,167,163,0.6)] bg-[rgba(14,167,163,0.12)] text-[#F4F7F8]\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#0EA7A3] text-[#061923]\">✓</span>اولویت ویزیت</span><span class=\"h-px w-5 bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.16)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition border-[rgba(39,214,208,0.7)] bg-[rgba(39,214,208,0.1)] text-[#F4F7F8] shadow-sm\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#27D6D0] text-[#061923]\">6</span>پزشک</span><span class=\"h-px w-5 bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.16)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.12)] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.04)] text-[#9FB3B7]\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] text-[#9FB3B7]\">7</span>رزرو</span><span class=\"h-px w-5 bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.16)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.12)] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.04)] text-[#9FB3B7]\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] text-[#9FB3B7]\">8</span>خلاصه</span></li></ol></nav><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white p-6 text-[#183B56] shadow-sm sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between\"><div><span class=\"rounded-full border border-teal-200 bg-teal-50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-teal-800\">تطبیق هوشمند پزشک</span><h1 class=\"mt-4 text-3xl font-bold text-blue-950\">پزشکان پیشنهادی</h1><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-[#64748B]\">این پیشنهادها بر اساس<!-- --> <span class=\"font-bold\">بر اساس اطلاعات اولیه</span> <!-- -->و اولویت‌های انتخاب پزشک شما رتبه‌بندی شده‌اند.</p></div><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-5 py-3 text-center text-[#183B56] hover:border-[#20C9C3] hover:bg-[#EAFBF8]\" href=\"/visit-preference\">اصلاح اولویت‌ها</a></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-5\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white p-5 text-[#183B56] shadow-sm md:col-span-2\"><h2 class=\"font-bold\">مبنای تطبیق</h2><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7\">بر اساس اطلاعات اولیه</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-teal-200 bg-teal-50 p-5 text-teal-900\"><h2 class=\"font-bold\">نوع ویزیت</h2><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7\">فرقی ندارد</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-teal-200 bg-teal-50 p-5 text-teal-900\"><h2 class=\"font-bold\">اولویت بیمار</h2><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7\">تعادل همه موارد</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-5 border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white text-[#64748B]\"><h2 class=\"font-bold\">درجه هشدار</h2><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7\">نامشخص</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#EAFBF8] p-5 text-[#183B56]\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-blue-900\">خلاصه برای پزشک</h2><p class=\"mt-3 leading-8 text-gray-700\">خلاصه‌ای از تحلیل اولیه ثبت نشده است.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-teal-300 bg-teal-50 p-6\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-teal-800\">بهترین تطبیق پیشنهادی</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900\">دکتر سارا کیانی</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-teal-800\">پزشک عمومی<!-- --> | امتیاز تطبیق: <!-- -->91<!-- -->٪</p></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-5\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-lg border-[#20C9C3]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#102A43]\">دکتر سارا کیانی</h2><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#0E8F8A]\">پیشنهاد اول</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#20C9C3] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#102A43]\">تخصص مرتبط</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#102A43]\">نوبت نزدیک</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#102A43]\">آنلاین</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#102A43]\">حضوری</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[#27D6D0]\">پزشک عمومی</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[#64748B]\">مرکز درمانی مهر</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#64748B]\">خیابان مطهری، نرسیده به سهروردی</p><div class=\"mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm text-[#183B56] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-4 py-2\">نوع ویزیت: <!-- -->آنلاین / حضوری</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-4 py-2\">فاصله: <!-- -->۱.۲ کیلومتر</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-4 py-2\">امتیاز پزشک: <!-- -->4.6</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-4 py-2\">خوش‌قولی: <!-- -->84<!-- -->٪</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-4 py-2\">اولین نوبت: <!-- -->امروز، ساعت ۲۰:۰۰</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#20C9C3] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-4 py-2 font-bold text-[#102A43]\">امتیاز تطبیق: <!-- -->91<!-- -->٪</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-4 py-2\">تعرفه نمونه: <!-- -->۲۸۰٬۰۰۰ تومان</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#F6FBFC] p-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#183B56]\"><span class=\"font-bold\">چرا این پزشک پیشنهاد شد؟</span> <!-- -->تخصص پزشک با مسیر مراجعه مرتبط است</p></div><div class=\"flex min-w-[170px] flex-col gap-3\"><a class=\"rounded-2xl bg-[#20C9C3] px-6 py-3 text-center font-bold text-[#102A43] shadow-sm hover:bg-[#0E8F8A] hover:text-white\" href=\"/booking\">انتخاب و رزرو</a></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-lg border-[#D7ECEF]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#102A43]\">دکتر نازنین احمدی</h2><span class=\"rounded-full border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-amber-900\">امتیاز بالا</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#102A43]\">نوبت نزدیک</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#64748B]\">تأخیر کم</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#102A43]\">آنلاین</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#102A43]\">حضوری</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[#27D6D0]\">متخصص داخلی</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[#64748B]\">کلینیک سلامت نوین</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#64748B]\">خیابان ولیعصر، بالاتر از پارک ملت</p><div class=\"mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm text-[#183B56] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-4 py-2\">نوع ویزیت: <!-- -->آنلاین / حضوری</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-4 py-2\">فاصله: <!-- -->۲.۴ کیلومتر</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-4 py-2\">امتیاز پزشک: <!-- -->4.8</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-4 py-2\">خوش‌قولی: <!-- -->88<!-- -->٪</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-4 py-2\">اولین نوبت: <!-- -->امروز، ساعت ۱۸:۳۰</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#20C9C3] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-4 py-2 font-bold text-[#102A43]\">امتیاز تطبیق: <!-- -->73<!-- -->٪</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white px-4 py-2\">تعرفه نمونه: <!-- -->۴۲۰٬۰۰۰ تومان</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#F6FBFC] p-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#183B56]\"><span class=\"font-bold\">چرا این پزشک پیشنهاد شد؟</span> <!-- -->بر اساس ترکیب تخصص، دسترسی، امتیاز و اولویت‌های شما پیشنهاد شده است</p></div><div class=\"flex min-w-[170px] flex-col gap-3\"><a class=\"rounded-2xl bg-[#20C9C3] px-6 py-3 text-center font-bold text-[#102A43] shadow-sm hover:bg-[#0E8F8A] hover:text-white\" href=\"/booking\">انتخاب و رزرو</a></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-lg border-[#D7ECEF]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#102A43]\">دکتر کامیار توکلی</h2><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#102A43]\">نوبت نزدیک</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#102A43]\">آنلاین</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7ECEF] bg-[#EAFBF8] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#102A43]\">حضوری</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[#27D6D0]\">طب فیزیکی و توان‌بخشی</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[#64748B]\">مرکز توان‌بخشی حرکت</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#64748B]\">خیابان شریعتی، حوالی قلهک</p><div class=\"mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm text-[#183B56] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#D7E